'''Wiglett''' (Japanese: '''ウミディグダ''' ''Umidigda'') is a {{ct|Water}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Shining Revelry}} expansion.

